{"esm": "1.1.0", "metadata": {"name": "hinterp_step20_inputs", "description": "Input fields of inline test `hinterp_step20` of FireWindHinterpWRFFire: the 19 x 19 atmosphere-grid mid-flame winds ua and va at step 20 of the fire_behavior test7 standalone run, and the 80 x 80 fractional atmosphere-grid coordinates of the fire cells. The coordinates are proj%Calc_ij applied to each fire cell's latitude and longitude -- they are geometry, not a refinement ratio, and are NOT affine in the fire index. Dumps data/eqwefic/dumps/fire/run_hinterp/esm_dump_hinterp_{55,56}.json: Interpolate_vars_atm_to_fire interpolates six variables per atmosphere update in the order ua, va, t2, q2, psfc, rain, and the atmosphere state refreshes every interval_atm = 1 s against dt = 0.5 s, so the tenth update (step 20) is bilinear calls 55 and 56. Confirmed by construction: call 55's data_out reproduces the uf field of esm_dump_ls_tend_58 with Linf exactly 0. Generated data -- do not edit.", "license": "MIT", "tags": ["test-inputs", "generated"]}, "expression_templates": {"input_u_src": {"params": [], "match": {"op": "input_u_src", "args": []}, "body": {"op": "faq", "output_idx": ["i", "j"], "args": [], "ranges": {"i": {"from": "src_x"}, "j": {"from": "src_y"}}, "expr": {"op": "index", "args": [{"op": "const", "args": [], "value": [[0.8016912937164307, 0.8060135841369629, 0.8091170787811279, 0.8129852414131165, 0.8154474496841431, 0.8207721710205078, 0.8241752982139587, 0.830250084400177, 0.8364798426628113, 0.8403897285461426, 0.8476297855377197, 0.8314363360404968, 0.8116109371185303, 0.800237774848938, 0.796882152557373, 0.7918636798858643, 0.7880045175552368, 0.7825706005096436, 0.787104070186615], [0.8040152788162231, 0.8112726211547852, 0.8186304569244385, 0.8267651200294495, 0.8325862288475037, 0.8431814312934875, 0.8524105548858643, 0.8626284599304199, 0.8735446333885193, 0.878772497177124, 0.8684042692184448, 0.8465930223464966, 0.8233786225318909, 0.8077186346054077, 0.79972648620605